  "tagline": "Commercial cloud and enterprise distribution of Apache Doris from its core maintainers.",
  "description": "VeloDB is the company and product line built by core Apache Doris contributors (the company behind SelectDB). VeloDB Cloud is a managed, compute-storage separated Doris service that runs in VeloDB's cloud or as BYOC in your account, and VeloDB Enterprise packages hardened Doris builds, a cluster manager and Kubernetes operator for self-managed deployments. It brings Doris' real-time analytics, log search with inverted indexes, and lakehouse federation to teams that do not want to operate Doris themselves. Choosing it means a single-vendor commercial relationship around an Apache-licensed core.",
